# Build context exclusions.
# This recipe has no Containerfile — start.sh pulls the prebuilt
# ghcr.io/niko1221/strata image, so nothing is ever sent to a builder today.
# This file is the safety net for any future build context (e.g. a derived
# image): the ~181 GB data dir, secrets, logs and VCS data must never be
# uploaded to a build.
.git
.gitignore
example/
strata-data/
.env
*.log
__pycache__
*.pyc
